---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="页面未找到"
  description="你访问的页面不存在，或已经移动。"
>
  <section class="content not-found" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <p class="not-found-code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
    <h1 id="not-found-title">页面未找到</h1>
    <p>你访问的页面不存在，或已经移动。可以返回首页，或继续浏览文章。</p>
    <nav class="not-found-actions" aria-label="页面恢复选项">
      <a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a class="button" href="/blog/">浏览文章</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
